{"version":1,"content":"<p>淡出螢光幕多年的78歲台灣資深影后甄珍，近年與兒子章立衡（本名劉子千）多在香港低調生活。</p><p>章立衡於前日（23日）晚間罕見在社交網公開母子同框照，並熱情寫下「歡迎來長沙玩」，引發外界關注。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;照片中</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.391167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.028095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.028095+00:00","content_hash":"b45d8aac740cd2078dfdc09c6f27e85aa73fb073829a0bb77bb91ffe55644e65","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}